This package contains a private build of whisper.cpp 1.8.3, from
https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp/tree/v1.8.3, under the MIT license.
The upstream copyright and permission notice is included in WHISPER-LICENSE.
The local state-metrics.cpp extension reads six accumulated state timing
counters and exposes CPU streaming VAD using the pinned upstream graph while
retaining its recurrent state between frames. It does not change speech
recognition model computation or decoding. The source and
license downloads are SHA-256 pinned in scripts/build-state-metrics.sh.

GGML and its CPU/GPU implementations remain separately installed distribution
libraries. No GGML backend, model, toolchain or development headers are bundled.
Build headers are SHA-256 pinned from Ubuntu libwhisper-dev 1.8.3+dfsg-2 and
libggml-dev 0.9.11-1. See https://github.com/ggml-org/ggml and the distribution's
installed GGML copyright file for its MIT license.

The private library is loaded by an explicit sibling path, not by searching for
a system libwhisper. Upstream changes require rebuilding and validating this
package; no binary state layout is guessed by the worker.
